# AI Resume Analyser

## Overview
AI Resume Analyser is a Python-based application that analyses resumes using Natural Language Processing (NLP). It compares resumes with job descriptions, extracts skills, calculates an ATS compatibility score, and provides suggestions to improve resumes.

## Features
- Resume Parsing (PDF/DOCX)
- ATS Score Calculation
- Skill Extraction
- Job Description Matching
- Resume Suggestions
- Interactive Dashboard

## Technologies
- Python
- Streamlit
- spaCy
- NLTK
- Scikit-learn
- Pandas
- PyPDF2

